00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:39.290
- [Kelly] Cool, I'm into it.

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:41.510
- You were so good on the ACMs

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:44.330
with one of the hardest
songs to sing in life.

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:45.717
